      "content": "That's a good start. To get more specific for the brief, could you expand on those \"challenges\" you mentioned? Specifically, when looking at the friction points, do you see higher risks of social fragmentation or a breakdown in shared community norms when the religious or cultural values of the new arrivals are significantly different from the local population? I'm interested in whether this leads to parallel societies rather than integration.",
